          "end": 99.68,
          "en": "So hashtag username selects by ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 99.826,
          "end": 104.086,
          "en": "Let's now give this here the ID username so that this is selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 104.828,
          "end": 106.119,
          "en": "And now we get access to this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 106.119,
          "end": 110.993,
          "en": "element, and since it's input element, this will have a value property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 111.795,
          "end": 113.43,
          "en": "And if we do that and we save that all,",
